        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at 12 m2 Cu collector, one-family house, for combined system</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at 12 m2 Cu collector, one-family house, for combined system
Use of a solar system excluding the necessary auxiliary heating. The simulation is made for solar collector systems in the city of Zurich. The annual irradiation amounts to 1249 kWh/m2. 28% solar fraction, 35° inclination, 22° southeast orientation.;
UUID: 44440c79-83e8-335f-bf4e-0c98e6a48b1c
Delivery of heat with a solar system including maintenance and electricity use for operation. Excluding the necessary auxiliary heating.
Location: Solar collector system operated in CH.
Technology: Solar collector system for hot water installed on the roof of a house.
Time period: Time of simulation.
Production volume: Total heat delivered by flat plate collectors in CH in 2008 was 213'500 MWh.
Sampling: Own simulation. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_44440c79-83e8-335f-bf4e-0c98e6a48b1c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
